  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Women&#xb4;s economic empowerm WB Kenya - women&#xb4;s economic empowerm</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Women&#xb4;s economic empowerm WB Kenya</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sida har beslutat att sekondera en gender specialist till V&#xe4;rldsbankens kontor (VB) i Kenya under perioden 1 september 2008 tom l&#xe4;ngst september 2011. Denna sekundering &#xe4;r i linje med Sidas st&#xf6;d f&#xf6;r j&#xe4;mst&#xe4;lldhet i V&#xe4;rldsbanken och s&#xe4;rskilt VB Gender Action Plan 2007-2010. Efter en f&#xf6;rfr&#xe5;gan fr&#xe5;n VB har sekunderingen f&#xf6;rl&#xe4;ngts fram till juli 2012.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sida has made a decision for a secondment of a gender specialist to the World Banks&apos; office in Kenya 1 September 2008 to the 1st September 2011. This support is in accordance with Sida&apos;s support to the World Bank on gender equality and especially the World Bank&apos;s Gender Action Plan 2007-2010. By request by the World Bank an extension of the secondment was made until July 2012.</narrative>
  </description>
